        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ contents: [{ role: \"user\", parts: [{ text: \"You are a retail sales analyst for \" + ($(\"Edit Fields\").first().json.businessName || \"our business\") + \". Using the data below (currency: \" + ($(\"Edit Fields\").first().json.currency || \"KES\") + \"), write a concise weekly sales ALERT report (revenue dropped more than 20% vs the previous period): key figures, revenue change vs the previous period, top products, and 3 actionable recommendations. Format the answer as a clean HTML email body only: use <h2>, <h3>, <p>, <ul>/<li>, <strong> and a <table> with inline border styles for the key figures. Do NOT use Markdown, do NOT wrap the answer in code fences, and do NOT include <html>, <head> or <body> tags.\\n\\n\" + JSON.stringify($json, null, 2) }] }] }) }}",
